Dive into the repair home design game! Makeover various living spaces. Choose what to do: merge furniture and create room design, remodel old apartments or build amazing mansion. Merge items to create tools and furniture for unique room decor. Transform shabby apartments into coveted real estate. Solve funny puzzles and train your brain and designer skills by fixing furniture. Merge Design is the ultimate game for those who love to create beautiful spaces and experiment with different styles.
Enjoy addictive gameplay! Start from the floor, plan the furniture layout, pick accessories, mix and match colors by solving merge puzzles. Become an expert room planner in this exciting restoration game!
Make a house a home
Meet our charming characters and help them restore their family homes to their former glory. A creative chef kitchen remodel or a french bedroom do-over can turn a lifeless house into a cozy home. A new look for a living room can become a fresh start for your friends and customers. Become their friend and help them build a house of their dreams!
Relaxing merge gameplay
Solve fun puzzles and complete levels after levels of this addictive merge game. Grow trees in your merge garden for quality timber and sell extra items to get coins for your home makeover project. Receive rewards for your manor renovation progress and gratitude of your clients who will become your friends.
Merge Design features:
- Exciting levels with unique rooms and merge challenges;
- Decorating interior inspiration and home design ideas;
- Gorgeous visuals and realistic graphics;
- Different boosters to make the game more comfortable;
- Heartwarming stories, likeable characters, and funny dialogs;
- Dynamic and fun gameplay with in-app purchases that help you play;
- Regular updates and fixes for a smooth experience and more addictive puzzles.
Become a professional home decorator! Create dream houses for your customers — from farms and cottages to glamorous villas and mansions. Сombine and match objects and materials to create new appliances and furnishings. Start restorations and become a true designer. Play improvement home or garden decorating addictive games. Merge accessories to create stunning living spaces. Enjoy tons of levels to remodel houses in designing games!

